          IDENT  SUM,100B,START
          ABS
          ORG    100B
*         SUM, SUM OF SQUARES AND FACTORIAL OF THE INTEGERS 1 TO N.
*
*         ABSOLUTE CPU PROGRAM: LOADED AT RA+100B, IT STARTS AT START
*         AND STOPS ON THE PS INSTRUCTION. THE RESULTS ARE STORED IN
*         SUM, SQUARES AND FACT (SEE THE MEMORY TAB).
*
N         EQU    10D         NUMBER OF TERMS
*
START     SB1    1           B1 = 1 (CONSTANT)
          SB2    N           B2 = I, FROM N DOWN TO 1
          SX6    B0          X6 = SUM
          SX7    B0          X7 = SUM OF SQUARES
          SX5    B1          X5 = FACTORIAL
LOOP      SX1    B2          X1 = I
          IX6    X6+X1       SUM = SUM + I
          IX2    X1*X1       I*I (INTEGER PRODUCT)
          IX7    X7+X2       SQUARES = SQUARES + I*I
          IX5    X5*X1       FACT = FACT * I
          SB2    B2-B1       I = I - 1
          NE     B2,B0,LOOP  LOOP WHILE I IS NOT ZERO
*
          SA6    SUM         STORE THE RESULTS
          SA7    SQUARES
          BX6    X5
          SA6    FACT
          PS                 PROGRAM STOP
*
SUM       BSS    1           55 (67B)
SQUARES   BSS    1           385 (601B)
FACT      BSS    1           3628800 (15657000B)
          END
